# held/props/mug: the tankard (PROPS, P2b): a wooden mug with a brass band and a head of foam, in the right hand for
# Drink, SitDrink, SitFloorDrink and Cheer (doll_internal.h postureProp). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Drawn around the pose
# arms' grips (arms/adult/pose: hold, mouth, raise, wave2) and anchored on the right shoulder, so it rides the arm; under
# the hand (the fist covers the handle), on hairFront where the arm comes before the face, behind the body from behind.
